segments.en:
Laws of the Statutes of the Nations — Halachos 1, 2 & 3

body { font-family: Georgia, serif; max-width: 820px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 24px; background: #fdfaf5; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.9; }

h1 { font-size: 1.45em; text-align: center; color: #4a2c00; border-bottom: 2px solid #c8a96e; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

.subtitle { text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #7a5c2e; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 0.95em; }

.halacha-title { text-align: center; font-size: 1.15em; font-weight: bold; color: #4a2c00; margin: 44px 0 6px 0; border-top: 1px solid #c8a96e; padding-top: 18px; }

.halacha-source { text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #7a5c2e; margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 0.9em; }

.halacha-intro { background: #f5f0e8; border-left: 4px solid #c8a96e; padding: 13px 18px; margin: 12px 0 22px 0; font-style: italic; color: #5a3e1b; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }

.sec-header { display: flex; align-items: center; margin: 30px 0 12px 0; }

.sec-badge { background: #4a2c00; color: #fdf6e3; font-size: 0.82em; font-weight: bold; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; white-space: nowrap; }

.sec-rule { flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #ddd0b8; margin-left: 12px; }

p { margin: 0 0 18px 0; text-align: justify; }

.colophon { text-align: center; margin: 40px 0 10px 0; padding: 14px; background: #f5f0e8; border-radius: 8px; font-style: italic; color: #7a5c2e; font-size: 0.9em; }

Laws of the Statutes of the Nations

(Hilchos Chukkas HaAkum)
